{"to":"tom-becker","message":"Tom, good energy on S-0009 — but Sofia has Hannah Clarke booked for a test drive at 11:00 today on that car. She got the live customer first, so it's hers for now ("first one wins").

That said, you've got two i4 leads of your own: Chloe White (£56,200 budget — covers the list price) and Olivia Ahmed (£49,700). Chloe's the one to keep warm. If Hannah doesn't proceed, S-0009 is yours.

Don't cut corners on anything."}

